  <item>
    <title>【紧急加播】上海折叠，艺术游牧——上海艺术周 2026</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6af2fe335b7c4709bfe40e52</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6af2fe335b7c4709bfe40e52</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 11:23:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>上海艺术周像一场季风，城市在它的吹拂里换了一种呼吸。边走边看，艺术漫步。没边儿絮语～</span><br><br><strong><span>时间线：</span><br></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="36">00:36</a>&nbsp;明日博物馆播客——“年更变日更”的自嘲</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a>&nbsp;上海艺术季的蓬勃生机</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">03:40</a>&nbsp;艺术游牧：画廊机构的迁徙、扎根与新生</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a>&nbsp;肉身看展还是朋友圈看展</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a>&nbsp;邀请函、VIP日与“局内人”体验？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a>&nbsp;西岸艺术与设计博览会：四场馆漫步</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a>&nbsp;021博览会</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a>&nbsp;Futurelab艺术与设计教育博览会</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a>&nbsp;平行艺博会Hangover Shanghai：替代性空间中的国际画廊与社区实验</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a>&nbsp;梧桐区City Walk：老洋房、弄堂与“上海折叠”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a>&nbsp;荣宅巫鸿策划的展览《传奇：与荣宅的跨时空对话》，武康路狮语画廊，E.SCAPE新展《渐次展开的意向》，与何东旧居Bank Gallery</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a>&nbsp;“艺术家请客” 第二届，与喇格纳小学：学校作为艺术场域</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a>&nbsp;水脉即文脉：苏州河、黄浦江与艺术自然发生地</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a>&nbsp;外滩—虎丘路画廊群：贝浩登画廊、里森画廊、阿尔敏·莱希画廊等</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1280">21:20</a>&nbsp;西岸据点：星美术馆、龙美术馆与蓬皮杜合作</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1360">22:40</a>&nbsp;浦东美术馆、民生现代美术馆贾科梅蒂与其他的散落的美术馆场地</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1460">24:20</a>&nbsp;上海发电厂当代艺术博物馆 Power Station of Art：刘建华个展“大始”与刘家琨首个个展“明月构想”</span><br><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a> M50老牌画廊区与青浦嘉定松江郊野艺术</span><br><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> hi艺术行走地图</span><br><br><span>上海艺术天书 </span><a href="https://www.annotated.earth/#map" data-url="https://www.annotated.earth/#map"><span>www.annotated.earth</span></a><br><br><strong><span>音乐：</span></strong><br><span>Jasing Rye - Bordeaux, Aussi Une Couleur（波尔多也是一种颜色）；</span><br><span>Alva Noto,坂本龍一 - City Radieuse</span></p>]]></description>
