  </item>
  <item>
    <title>在“一峰一谷”间溯溪而上，寻找公共艺术之趣</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a019ee1e1eb34a9392ca199</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a019ee1e1eb34a9392ca199</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 11 May 2026 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：唐誉祯，策展人，就职于UCCA Lab，第十五届国际园林博览会——“中国姿态·养眼睛彩”龙湾公共环境艺术展策展人。</span></p><p><strong><span>时间线：</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">01:35</a> 主持人及嘉宾介绍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">02:25</a> 策展人与策展结缘</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="263">04:23</a> “中国姿态·养眼睛彩”作为中国（温州）国际园博会龙湾公共艺术分会场的筹备工作</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="368">06:08</a> 展览所在现场，中国眼谷，黄石山雕塑公园，形成了“一峰一谷”的策展理念</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 追溯温州的城市进程，及龙湾作为艺术落脚点第一站</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="687">11:27</a> 公共艺术策展的在地性，文化特征</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a> 城市的视觉体验更新，及给于公众的视觉挑战</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 黄石山雕塑公园区块的地质环境带来的策展灵感及文脉梳理</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1056">17:36</a> 古早方案中的“隐形者”作品，设想在水道中游走</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1173">19:33</a> 黄石山曾经作为采石场，现在为雕塑公园</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1348">22:28</a> 游船观感的可能性，与观众互动的多重体验</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1522">25:22</a> 克劳蒂亚·孔德的作品《闪电交响曲》在雕塑公园被小朋友攀爬游玩</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1631">27:11</a> 分号C作品《涟漪与涟漪》与一只白鹭完美同款</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1824">30:24</a> 沈烈毅作品《跷跷板》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1945">32:25</a> Ivo Schoofs《光标》，动态幽默？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2315">38:35</a> 雷磊《刺猬头》雕塑作品</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2570">42:50</a> 刘毅《光语者》霓虹装置作品</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2860">47:40</a> 大地艺术 VS 公共艺术&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3272">54:32</a> UCCA Lab后续的展览相关公共活动</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3536">58:56</a> 策展人荐书</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhlBjCxS0oVk5g_uMgK9qS5op1zR.jpg"></figure><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63804ec423c4fff76235647d/loXXp1XKN7jFyZe0frQkSQQtTsZk.m4a" length="61512887" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:03:23</itunes:duration>
