    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>巨蜥、叻沙、娘惹峇峇，新加坡的熟悉感与陌生感以及艺术地图:</span></p><span></span><p><span>新加坡艺术周｜艺术博览会｜新加坡双年展</span></p><span></span><p><span>🇸🇬🦁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="163">2:43</a> 游客须知</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">6:10</a> 滨海湾花园，金沙酒店，Marina Bay</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="463">7:43</a> Bacha 咖啡☕️ VS. Kopi 咖啡</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚶‍♀️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="746">12:26</a> 新加坡艺术博览会（1.23-1.25），新加坡艺术周SAW（1.22-1.31）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="955">15:55</a> 艺博会上的行为艺术表演</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1048">17:28</a> 展览及表演项目：环海旅社（Wan Hai Hotel: Singapore Strait），位于新加坡罗宾逊码头，仓库酒店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1459">24:19</a> 年轻文创区河谷地区 River Valley - New Bahru</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1626">27:06</a> 吉门营房画廊（Gillman Barracks）区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">28:20</a> 新加坡国家美术馆 Singapore National Gallery</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2120">35:20</a> 儿童双年展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a> 新加坡双年展：“纯粹意向”，分布于新加坡岛上的 5 个区域和 28 个不同的公共空间</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌊🏖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2879">47:59</a> 圣淘沙（Sentosa）度假模式开启🔛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3001">50:01</a> 巨蜥🦎出现了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3196">53:16</a> CityWalk，去如切街，娘惹老房子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3282">54:42</a> 新加坡的动物园：河川生态园，夜间动物园，飞禽园，都位于万态生态保护区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3465">57:45</a> 美食来了: 海南鸡饭、亚坤、吐司工坊，松发肉骨茶，大食代，牛车水</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3750">01:02:30</a>: Maxwell 食阁，米其林集散地，吃吃吃！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>预祝马🐎年吉祥！</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtWdBh2BAXG7WhBaPn1iaIUDo3O4.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
