    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>久違了，終於復更了！開心！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「明日博物館」</span></strong><span>迎來了第二季！我想“她”會變得更為簡短而輕快，可愛和靈動。在第二季中我會推出「全球100間·博物館」計劃，希望能為大家推薦100間（先立下flag🚩）博物館/美術館！任重而道遠~開心也興奮~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Timeline：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="126">2:06</a> 直島著名的打卡地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">2:10</a> 草間彌生的大南瓜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="194">3:14</a> 直島-倍樂生之家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="222">3:42</a> 直島的讚助人——福武總一郎先生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">4:20</a> 直島的交通——輪渡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">5:20</a> 如果錯過了最後一班輪渡......</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="346">5:46</a> 倍樂生之家酒店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="371">6:11</a> 地中美術館</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="386">6:26</a> 鳥瞰地中美術館</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="463">7:43</a> 售票處與美術館之間的距離</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="526">8:46</a> 地中花園</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="546">9:06</a> 福武先生收藏的莫奈畫作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">9:55</a> 進入地中美術館</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="622">10:22</a> 安藤忠雄設計的地中美術館建築</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 三部永久陳列的藝術家作品：莫奈，瓦爾特德瑪利亞，James Turrell</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="745">12:25</a> 安藤忠雄建築中的引光與異象空間</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="827">13:47</a> 四角形中庭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="855">14:15</a> 三角形中庭</span></p><span>