  <item>
    <title>【六一儿童节特辑】儿童的美术馆，美术馆中的儿童——iSTART儿童艺术节十周年</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6657e9d5ad5aa5d8c25ae8a7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6657e9d5ad5aa5d8c25ae8a7</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 31 May 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><strong><span>时间线：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="272">4:32</a> iSTART儿童艺术节的源起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="497">8:17</a> 儿童在美术馆中可以找到友好的环境，有趣的体验吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="613">10:13</a> 回看iSTART的过去10年，从”第一届iSTART儿童艺术节“成长至今</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="877">14:37</a> iSTART儿童艺术节的特殊性和公共责任，一切都是为了儿童</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="983">16:23</a> “嘎嘎国”的创立者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1586">26:26</a> 创作“生活的积木”的小小艺术家，和爸爸一起创作，以及后来成为了“蚂蚁🐜专家”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> 孩子的世界，限高的门 1 米以上的成人“禁止入内”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2391">39:51</a> 国内外的儿童博物馆或践行儿童友好体验的博物馆/美术馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2435">40:35</a> 纽约的“数学博物馆”(National Museum of Mathematics)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2656">44:16</a> 波士顿儿童博物馆(Boston Children’s Museum | Boston Lyric Opera)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2725">45:25</a> 世界上最早的儿童博物馆——纽约布鲁克林儿童博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2828">47:08</a> 纽约Sugar Hill 儿童博物馆，绘本，戏剧，互动 （Sugar Hill Children's Museum of Art &amp; Storytelling）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3034">50:34</a> iSTART儿童艺术节十周年，正在成都A4美术馆正在发生，发声</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3499">58:19</a> 终身幼儿园：Lifelong kindergarten——同名书籍，及 MIT Media Lab 实验室之一</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3936">1:05:36</a> 为孩子做些什么的实际举措</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4016">1:06:56</a> 作为父母，我们可以做点什么。“父母商店” &amp; “儿童商店”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4116">1:08:36</a> &nbsp;改变视角，让我们和孩子成为朋友，成为伙伴</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqafvJj9no3lC8NF2Qw4RAkdnrIP.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnLYcD8mjV34KLj3w-BIV9nWTpS6.m4a" length="105893757" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiL2mhPAb_-bU5V76QZSzg5NGM15.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>覆写上海: 外滩美术馆的前尘与今世</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6652ff53c59d1e5757bf722f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6652ff53c59d1e5757bf722f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 May 2024 13:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="188">3:08</a> 外滩源及上海外滩美术馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">4:20</a> 外滩美术馆的前身: 亚洲文会(R.A.S)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="482">8:02</a> 曾经被誉为“中国境内最好的东方学图书馆”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="542">9:02</a> “博物院广场”的过去与现在</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="607">10:07</a> 外滩美术馆的四楼、五楼曾经是自然博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="671">11:11</a> “覆写上海：重构 20 世纪初的亚洲文会图书馆”的展览灵感来源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="954">15:54</a> "覆写上海"并非是以时间线串联的编年史展览，而是人物拼贴串联的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1097">18:17</a> 亚洲文会的重要人物：爱诗客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 亚洲文会的重要人物：福开森（汉学家，艺术品收藏家，文化交流使者）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1707">28:27</a> 亚洲文会的重要人物：伍连德</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> “覆写上海”的展签卡片如同图书馆中的 index card</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2534">42:14</a> “覆写上海”展览中对话当代艺术: 张如怡和陈荣辉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> “讲——堂”活动，汇集互动性，表演性，系统性的知识生产的表达，每月的不同主题的活动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> Cici 去参加的三月“讲堂”活动，打开味觉体验🍸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3140">52:20</a> “讲——堂”五月活动：关于“女性主义”议题的影像放映和映后会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3428">57:08</a> 放映🎥：女星——女侠——女妖——女工</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3822">1:03:42</a> Karen 推荐我们去的小而美的图书馆、博物馆</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvDq0UoFv57JakZ5eC8npDtCBdeU.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lta7IEsfu3Q1yFaO5SyUINRlZGdT.m4a" length="100287993" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:09:06</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiPAPimjD_orVFMl78OtkWmfRNgu.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>[5·18国际博物馆日]——抵达精神的乌托邦</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6648690182b428eafd6a1baf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6648690182b428eafd6a1baf</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 18 May 2024 08:38:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>时间线：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">1:38</a> 广泛普及的5·18国际博物馆日</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">2:30</a> 每年博物馆日的特定主题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="222">3:42</a> "Museum"源自希腊词源Muse缪斯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">4:20</a> 博物馆的“珍奇阁”时代，未对公众开放</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="337">5:37</a> 博物馆的分类</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="454">7:34</a> 推荐书目《博物馆变迁》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="599">9:59</a> 博物馆与美术馆的区别：博物馆以科技、历史为主要展品，美术馆主要以艺术为主题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="675">11:15</a> AAM美国博物馆协会&amp;ICOM国际博物馆联盟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="746">12:26</a> 2024的博物馆日主题：博物馆致力于教育和研究</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="882">14:42</a> 在博物馆中践行“Lifelong Learning终身学习”的理念，参与到公共教育的项目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 博物馆之夜——“Mix and Mingle”🍸🎨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1071">17:51</a> 博物馆不仅仅可以看展览啦，完全可以“睡衣派对🎉”和“阳光下瑜伽”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">20:02</a> 小朋友们在霸王龙🦖旁边搭帐篷⛺️过夜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1296">21:36</a> 博物馆与学院合而为一，例如Marina Abramović Institute</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1436">23:56</a> 我们上半年的看展足迹👣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1466">24:26</a> 澳门艺术博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1509">25:09</a> 澳门大三巴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1671">27:51</a> 澳门大学艺术馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1888">31:28</a> 美国克利夫兰艺术博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2038">33:58</a> 安阳殷墟博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2136">35:36</a> 上海近现代新闻出版博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2253">37:33</a> 上海邮政博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2314">38:34</a> 上海电信博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2322">38:42</a> 上海体育博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2346">39:06</a> 上海证券博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2478">41:18</a> 上海交响音乐博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2587">43:07</a> 上海杨浦图书馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2660">44:20</a> 香港大馆(艺术活化及美术馆)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2783">46:23</a> 香港大馆展览——《青蛇》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2846">47:26</a> 香港 M+美术馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3005">50:05</a> 上海博物馆东馆——“星耀中国：三星堆·金沙古蜀文明展”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3130">52:10</a> 浦东美术馆——“光辉时代：普拉多博物馆中的西班牙往事”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3220">53:40</a> 西岸美术馆——“清醒梦境：声音的旅程”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3310">55:10</a> 外滩美术馆——有味觉体验的艺术表演，惊喜！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3410">56:50</a> 去浙江宁波、 绍兴的故居博物馆暴走：王羲之故居、蔡元培故居、王阳明故居、徐渭美术馆、青藤书屋、鲁迅故居。（20000 步起🚶‍♀️）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3712">1:01:52</a> 博物馆给予了我们观看世界的方式，与旅行地和居住地建立了更深厚的联系与情感纽带</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3905">1:05:05</a> Cici在上海交通大学ICCI的授课启发：”策展实践“课程与个人“收藏阁”的故事</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>祝大家【5·18 国际博物馆日】快乐！</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkbN5UsPiYpV08bzpnB-jIfolrFY.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
